        END
      ELSE 2 'G' STO 'N' PURGE CLLCD "El mecanismo no es de Grashof. Clase II"
      MSGBOX
      END CLLCD d a / 'K1' STO d c / 'K2' STO
      '(a^2-b^2+c^2+d^2)/(2*a*c)' EVAL 'K3' STO ï2 COS K1 - K2 ï2 COS * - K3 + 'A'
      STO 0 2 - ï2 SIN * 'B' STO K1 K2 1 + ï2 COS * - K3 + 'C' STO
      'ATAN((-B+É(B^2-4*A*C))/(2*A))*2' EVAL 'ï4' STO
      IF ï4 TYPE 1 ã
      THEN
        IF ï4 0 <
        THEN ï4 360 + 'ï4' STO
        END d b / 'K4' STO '(c^2-d^2-a^2-b^2)/(2*a*b)' EVAL 'K5' STO ï2 COS K1
        - K4 ï2 COS * + K5 + 'D' STO 0 2 - ï2 SIN * 'E' STO K1 K4 1 - ï2 COS * + K5 +
        'F' STO 'ATAN((-E+É(E^2-4*D*F))/(2*D))*2' EVAL 'ï3' STO
        IF ï3 0 <
